## Your First Workflow

1. **Open browser:** http://localhost:5678
2. **Login** with your credentials
3. **Click** "Add Workflow"
4. **Add a Schedule Trigger:**
   - Click the "+" button
   - Select "Schedule Trigger"
   - Set to run every 5 minutes
5. **Add HTTP Request:**
   - Click "+" after the trigger
   - Select "HTTP Request"
   - Method: GET
   - URL: https://api.github.com/zen
6. **Execute Workflow:** Click "Execute Workflow" button
7. **Activate:** Toggle switch in top-right

You should see the workflow execute successfully!

