## Common Commands

```bash
# Start n8n
cd ~/.n8n && docker-compose up -d

# Stop n8n
cd ~/.n8n && docker-compose down

# Restart n8n
cd ~/.n8n && docker-compose restart

# View logs (live)
cd ~/.n8n && docker-compose logs -f

# Update n8n
cd ~/.n8n && docker-compose pull && docker-compose up -d

# Backup data
tar -czf n8n-backup.tar.gz ~/.n8n
```

